WEBVTT

00:00:28.232 --> 00:00:30.860
the highway was littered 
with wriggling fish

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:36.532
and coated in a thick slime that took 
the fire department 7 hours to clear.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.036
Astonishingly good looks aside,

00:00:40.036 --> 00:00:44.040
the standout strength of all hagfishes
is their slime.

00:00:44.332 --> 00:00:48.461
In fact, they’re probably 
Earth’s slimiest animals.

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:51.130
But why be so slimy?

00:00:51.839 --> 00:00:53.174
Watch and learn.

00:00:54.342 --> 00:00:59.222
This hagfish has detected a dead fish
using its keen sense of smell

00:00:59.222 --> 00:01:02.225
and the tastebud-like organs 
dotting its skin.